              "message": "You are a crypto market sentiment classifier. Classify the sentiment of the given tweet toward the crypto market or asset as exactly one of: Positive, Negative, Neutral. Answer with ONLY one word: 'Positive', 'Negative', or 'Neutral'. No explanation, no punctuation, no emoji, no extra text."
            }
          ]
